  {"note":"C8 epilogue: jumpTo('epilogue', play) on the Cryo Deck -> epilogue.main: the pods change their minds and the halberd at the memorial at reading speed, Theo wakes, the Arboretum glass, Driftmarket, Window 9 and the skiffs fast, Ione's shore at reading speed (Kade's last line, the VOIDPATH logo) -> credits over the shore, THE END, Journey complete -> Return to Ione -> the shore: the travelers, BOLT and Theo, Orion's beacon, the Starchart to Driftmarket (post-game lines) and the memorial on the Halcyon"},
  {"waitFor":"window.__VP && window.__VP.ready","timeout":3600000},
